Apply the small integration changes below to the existing MaintenanceUiController.

1. Inject UiMaintenanceDataService in addition to existing dependencies.
2. At the beginning of maintenance(), call initialiseTestDataIfEnabled().
3. loadModel() should use uiMaintenanceDataService.getFacilityTypes()/getPurposeCodes().
4. For create/delete operations, branch when test-data mode is enabled:
   - testDataService.saveFacilityType(...)
   - testDataService.deleteFacilityType(...)
   - testDataService.savePurposeCode(...)
   - testDataService.deletePurposeCode(...)
5. Keep the existing production path completely unchanged when test-data mode is false.

This package intentionally does not replace the existing MaintenanceService.
